around mid to later June, like June 16th to

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:20.360
18th.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:25.949
We anticipate typically a 19 to 21 day lag
time between cases and deaths.

00:00:25.949 --> 00:00:33.019
And so if cases tart the spike between June
16 and 18, we would expect deaths to spike

00:00:33.019 --> 00:00:34.160
right now.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:36.339
And that's exactly what happened.

00:00:36.339 --> 00:00:43.159
